@* A word instead of a glyph, which is what a toggle wants when the state is a word rather than a
   shape. aria-pressed is set either way — that is what makes it a toggle and not a checkbox. *@
<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
    <Toggle Name="italic-text" aria-label="Toggle italic"><Icon Name="italic" />Italic</Toggle>
    <Toggle Variant="outline" Name="bold-text" aria-label="Toggle bold"><Icon Name="bold" />Bold</Toggle>
</div>
